    m_Untranslated: "This optional challenge is classified as Medium difficulty. If you\u2019re interested in completing it, read on. Otherwise, skip to the next step.  \n\nYou created an interesting tower using simple rectangles, but the tower could be much more interesting if you incorporated a few different shapes, like cylinders, cones, and prisms."
